@startuml component
title node-express-mongo — Component Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor Client

package "src/" {
  [server.js\n(entry)] as server
  [createApp\n(composition root)] as app
  [persons router\nGET / POST / GET:id / PATCH:id / DELETE:id] as router
  [validate-person\n(zod)] as zod
  [Person model\n(Mongoose schema)] as model
  [connect.js\n(retry loop)] as connect
  [loadConfig\n(zod env)] as cfg
}

database "MongoDB" as mongo

Client --> app : HTTP
app --> router
router --> zod : safeParse(body)
router --> model : find / findById / create / update / delete
model --> mongo : driver
server --> cfg : loadConfig()
server --> connect : connectMongo(url, retries)
connect --> mongo
server --> app : createApp()

note bottom of model
  - email unique (409 on dup)
  - timestamps auto
  - toJSON projects _id → id, drops __v
end note

note right of router
  All routes return JSON:
   200 ok, 201 created, 204 deleted,
   400 invalid body / objectid,
   404 not found, 409 dup email.
end note
@enduml
